# Split-DNS, served ONLY on the VPN address: the admin domain exists for VPN peers and nowhere else.
# There is NO public DNS record for the admin domain, so the existence of the admin is not advertised.
# (The ACME DNS-01 challenge needs only a temporary TXT record at the registrar; see README.)
listen-address=@WG_SERVER_ADDR@
bind-interfaces
no-resolv
no-hosts
address=/@ADMIN_HOST@/@WG_SERVER_ADDR@
# Everything else is not answered here: the phone keeps using its own resolver (split tunnel).
